Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1038-1040] Onigashima+ 42 - The Main Attraction.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:27.58,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(257,251)}Castle\NInterior
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:27.58,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(258,479)}Third\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Undo your Paralysis Technique, Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:41.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We will both perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:53.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1645,243)}Castle\NInterior
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:53.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1645,471)}Second\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's scorching!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scorching enough to kill a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:11.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:14.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ceiling's going to collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.09,0:02:17.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:32.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Jinbe, from the Straw Hat crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:37.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fire has yet to spread that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.53,0:02:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye! We're in your debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go dying yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye. Go, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:49.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!\NEverybody, on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why has the fire spread like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dying in battle is one thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there will be many more\Ncharred dead from the blaze itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:18.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1704,311)}Perfor-\Nmance\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to be here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd best get some distance from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:43.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the blazes...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I turned back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:08.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good for you, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:14.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The side effects from the\Nextended gigantification have passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.37,0:04:15.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to turn into a baby\Nand an old man at the same time...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.09,0:04:23.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The effects are great,\Nbut so are the risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:27.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And those strong side effects\Nmade me smaller and weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:30.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong, unpredictable\Nside effects!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.27,0:04:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miyagi...\NI'm worried about Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, because of the drug, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:43.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He had around 20 to 30 broken bones,\Non top of being bruised and battered...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In exchange for\Nthe temporary super healing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he'll suffer twice\Nas much as he did before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twice as bad as the serious injuries\Nthat immobilized him...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:04:59.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go dying on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.31,0:06:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:02.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on? I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...move my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it... Stop...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro Franky
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.87,0:06:20.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1708,324)}Dome\NInterior\NRight-\NBrain\NTower
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta the waaaay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where the hell'd you\Nwander off to, Zoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:41.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1731,457)}First\NFloor\NCrawl\NSpace
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:41.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1730,172)}Castle\NInterior
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:49.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's one of Whitebeard's\Ncommanders here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And why's he helping those\Nstupid newbies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:08.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1641,449)}First\NBasement\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:08.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1640,204)}Castle\NInterior
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I let them get the better of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grunts they may be,\Nthey are still Animal Kingdom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku... Kin'emon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope you were able to\Nescape without issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed, we are Aigis Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We knew you were here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's pretend we\Nnever saw each other, Izo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are in no position to ignore\Nwhat remains of the Whitebeard Pirates...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:07:59.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for committing a historical crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But for now, our business is\Nwith the Straw Hats alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:09.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Until we meet again, elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...CP-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:29.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:30.00,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1666,312)}Castle\NBasement
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:30.00,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1663,497)}Armory
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must reach...\Nmust reach in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And thus shall all...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...be led unto their graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:55.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no!\NWait, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:07.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Namuji...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Glacier Fang!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this much gunpowder\Nwere to explode,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all would be lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will not make contact\Nwith the gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mahoroba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:10:01.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:15.61,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1662,416)}Perfor-\Nmance\NFloor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:26.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our bosses can't move anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they take any more than they already have,\Nthey'll die for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give 'em a break, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pity from your underlings...\NYour reputation's going down the drain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, stat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:49.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss! Stay with us!\NIs he even breathing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss! Stay with us!\NIs he even breathing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.03,0:11:08.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!\NThis is a battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,God of Lightning, Tenjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:22.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll burn all the garbage,\Nburnable or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:33.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard Kaido give\Nhis shout of victory yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're still fooling around\Nwith that half-pint Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:48.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take us to the rooftop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm positively pooped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's finish 'em all in one sitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turning your back\Non the battlefield...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Room:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anesthesia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:13.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's wrap this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's wrap this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's wrap this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:31.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:31.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:33.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:35.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Traf!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with that ginormous sword?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know it was effective last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no pain from the penetration.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:49.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:57.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sth.o Sthop!\NYuh're gonnuh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shock Wille!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:33.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...!\NI'm being pulled!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid ass loudmouthed\Nsteel beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My magnetism rules you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.41,0:13:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My magnetism rules you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:56.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My magnetism rules you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still standing, Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want my head that badly, do ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.97,0:14:19.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I feel like some other purpose\Nis driving me right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:22.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm guessin' Kaido up there's\Nabout done, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:32.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even dripping water\Ncan hollow out a stone over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:34.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't nothin' in this world\Nthat don't take damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk Corna Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.75,0:14:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk Corna Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.57,0:15:12.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's bigger than the gigantified Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:20.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:23.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up, grandma...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll get to the rooftop...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,over our dead bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:15:59.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is moving backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must keep it as far away\Nfrom the capital as possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not let...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:17.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...this thing crash\Ninto the capitaaaal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:25.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone... calls for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He sent Big Mom flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom isn't down\Nfor the count, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.09,0:16:53.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feelin' it now, ya gross hag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:09.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Eustasser.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the second time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You showed me up by throwing out that attack\Nafter my big ability, then acted like you won by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not your damn opening act!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares?!\NKeep yer dumb ideas to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about you\Ntake the lead next, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on, give her a good slug!\NThen I'll come in and finish the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:37.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm killin' the old fart\Nwith my badass-est attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.26,0:17:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, what comes after the bull?\NA hippo? An elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap! I told ya,\NI ain't showin' you what's up my sleeve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:47.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's boutta get hit for talking smack\Nabout our boss like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those shockwaves inside me...\NFeels like I cracked some ribs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar's technique is a real threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:13.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar's technique is a real threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:15.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar's technique is a real threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:19.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think she likes my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so fulla yourself, asshat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:28.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give you life...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:31.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back to life,\Nbones of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So here's something\Nthat isn't a joke...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The next round's gonna\Nuse up all I've got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:56.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm ending it with the next pass\Nwe make at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I won't miss.\NSo I'm gonna need you to—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just told you to\Nnot tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.93,0:19:05.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:11.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:11.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:15.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can keep knocking you back all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:18.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maser Saber!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:35.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Joke's on you!\NIt was scrap metal to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:37.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The joke's on you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:39.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've sent hundreds of\Npunks like you to the seabed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:45.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've reigned for decades...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've reigned for decades...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...before you twerps...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.02,0:19:52.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were weaned off your mothers' milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:52.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Assign!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Assign!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:54.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Assign!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"S"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hnaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.03,0:20:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hnaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:37.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:39.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She stood up with\Nthe whole tower on her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell of a load you stuck me with!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:47.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's just wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:21:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.61,0:22:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You senile old ass hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You unruly brat...\NKnow your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother's Visit Cannon:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:17.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,3,000 Leagues of Misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.13,0:23:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't run from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.28,0:23:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!\NHer attack came to life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.23,0:24:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get them, Misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.36,0:24:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flatten those br—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Takt!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.00,0:24:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.64,0:24:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Room:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.73,0:24:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anesthesia!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.49,0:24:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Again with that trick, Trafalgar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.00,0:25:04.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.68,0:25:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.60,0:25:23.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got guts, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.10,0:25:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think you're not gonna let go,\Neh, Trafalgar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.15,0:25:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.99,0:25:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Captain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.70,0:25:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go! You're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet! Go deeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.42,0:25:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, dead already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:04.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puncture...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.60,0:26:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuh? Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.98,0:26:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Wille!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.88,0:26:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.51,0:26:40.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that giant hole?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.07,0:26:56.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.40,0:26:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! A hole, here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:07.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fry him to a crisp, Misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.95,0:27:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.91,0:27:12.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it, Eustasser!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nwuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.92,0:27:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.88,0:27:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make me\Nrepeat myself, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:21.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.23,0:27:33.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damned pups!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.90,0:27:42.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:46.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you can take me down!\NI'm Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.45,0:27:49.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I gotta murder ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.25,0:27:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damned Punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your era...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.63,0:27:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.92,0:28:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.24,0:28:23.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two think...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.74,0:28:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...you're soooo clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:35.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say there, runts!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must really, really like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.05,0:28:46.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be at the end\Nof your little act, though, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You probably thought\Nyou drove me into a corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:54.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but in the end you couldn't\Nput the final nail in the coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.81,0:28:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't win against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.48,0:29:03.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?! Why hasn't she been\Nblasted away yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even a blitz like that won't kill her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.12,0:29:08.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.99,0:29:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Both of our guys've capped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.00,0:29:18.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's gonna become of you once I've\Nknocked away your attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.75,0:29:23.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.88,0:29:28.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forfeit fifty years of your lifespans...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.43,0:29:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...or live, and become my slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.23,0:29:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.94,0:29:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:39.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:40.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.03,0:29:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's her Soul Pocus!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.15,0:29:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss, let's find a way outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.45,0:29:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's taking our lifespans too!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.91,0:29:56.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.75,0:29:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.75,0:30:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.59,0:30:11.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A dying creature\Nshouldn't be that powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.30,0:30:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm scaaaared!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.72,0:30:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain! We've gotta get\Ndistance from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.73,0:30:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.07,0:30:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take your own advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.90,0:30:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit yer screechin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.28,0:30:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up my lifespan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.29,0:30:37.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Become your slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.41,0:30:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.71,0:30:45.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would some one foot in the grave\Ngranny's chanting freak me out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.05,0:30:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They haven't lost a single second\Nof their lifespans!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.72,0:30:56.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they not the least bit afraid\Nof an Emperor of the Sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Room...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your death rattle would probably\Nmake my ears bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.11,0:31:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:13.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is something my savior would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:21.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just don't know when to give up,\Nhuh, Empress of the Sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.12,0:31:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout I give you a hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.50,0:31:25.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and send you to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.04,0:31:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Silent!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.97,0:31:32.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? The sound's all gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.27,0:31:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silent...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.56,0:31:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This technique cancels out\Nany and all noise created by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.07,0:31:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.78,0:31:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this?!\NMy voice... I can't speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.12,0:31:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:58.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.92,0:32:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's my follow-up!\NDamned Punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.25,0:32:06.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's my follow-up!\NDamned Punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.35,0:32:24.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.37,0:32:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.95,0:32:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.67,0:32:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help your Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.76,0:32:54.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Big Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.22,0:32:59.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why can I not hear her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.60,0:33:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing I touch makes a sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.14,0:33:08.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What have you done to me, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.41,0:33:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will cause a chain reaction!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.42,0:33:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.22,0:33:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!\NWhat is happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.48,0:33:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It all started with that...!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.11,0:34:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.58,0:34:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to\Ngo and say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.34,0:34:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My treasure?\NIf you want it, you can have it...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.97,0:34:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.97,0:34:22.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've left everything\Nthis world's got to offer there!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.19,0:34:32.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The whole world bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.03,0:34:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Great Pirate Era"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:42.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.53,0:34:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't care since you were\Nalready a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.63,0:34:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But when those kids rise up\Nall over the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.22,0:35:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...we're the ones that have to clean up\Nthat damn mess of runts you left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.04,0:35:33.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the... What's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.88,0:35:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.00,0:35:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is anyone there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.58,0:36:11.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Waaaateeeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.46,0:36:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear me, Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.34,0:36:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should've told us\Nbefore you died!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.43,0:36:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The One Piece...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.51,0:36:28.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it real?\NIt better be!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.89,0:36:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.81,0:36:38.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some of it's in\Nthis country too, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.57,0:36:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gaaah, I'm so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.17,0:36:56.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.08,0:36:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.42,0:37:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll both pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.96,0:37:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.34,0:37:07.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even think for a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.14,0:37:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not one second...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.10,0:37:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that this'll kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.95,0:37:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Empress of the Sea Big Mom versus\Nthe New Generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.66,0:37:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at the Battle of the Performance Floor,\NSkull Dome Interior.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.25,0:37:41.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The victors:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.67,0:37:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.63,0:37:45.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.34,0:37:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eustass "Captain" Kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.64,0:37:54.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:38:02.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Surgeon of Death" Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.23,0:38:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.19,0:38:05.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.95,0:38:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.36,0:38:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.53,0:38:12.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We beat Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.49,0:38:15.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a huge deal!\NReally huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.14,0:38:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not tell me...\NYou are...!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.02,0:38:37.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.94,0:38:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:46.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will do, for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.65,0:38:51.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice! Keep going, Momonosuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.62,0:38:53.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, 'tis you, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.91,0:38:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that the basement?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.87,0:38:58.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My word!\N'Tis exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.54,0:39:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.46,0:39:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of the bombs exploded,\Nand this is the result!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.34,0:39:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the explosion earlier\Nwas caused by Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye. I managed to freeze everything\Nbefore the whole armory exploded!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.39,0:39:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.48,0:39:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am glad to see you well!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.85,0:39:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As I am occupied at the moment,\NI ask you pay heed to what I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.07,0:39:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As we speak, it is nearing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.78,0:39:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zunesha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.16,0:39:37.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that the elephant Oden\Nmentioned in his journal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.80,0:39:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.43,0:40:00.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The very companion of Joyboy,\Nand the culprit behind a crime eight hundred years ago!
